{"title":"Cinderling","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 61 Fire Elemental that attacks with burn (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (4.5% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cinderling\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cinderling?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>152</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cinderling?lv=60\">Lv 60 <span>38</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cinderling?lv=61\">Lv 61 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/cinderling?lv=62\">Lv 62 <span>13</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/cinderling?lv=59\" title=\"Pick level 59\"><td><b>59</b></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>152</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/cinderling?lv=60\" title=\"Pick level 60\"><td><b>60</b></td><td>455</td><td>37.5</td><td>3,000</td><td class=\"muted\">1,365 · 52.5 · 9,000</td><td>38</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/cinderling?lv=61\" title=\"Pick level 61\"><td><b>61</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>462</td><td>38.1</td><td>3,050</td><td class=\"muted\">1,386 · 53.3 · 9,150</td><td>3</td><td>in the wilds around 231, -1253</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/cinderling\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>62</b></td><td>469</td><td>38.6</td><td>3,100</td><td class=\"muted\">1,407 · 54 · 9,300</td><td>13</td><td>in the wilds around 213, -1209</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"cinderling\" data-map-level=\"62\">Show level 62 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 14 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 18 recorded drops, 1,027 total, 15–484 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×15–484</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ember-core\" title=\"Ember Core - in 11 of 14 looted corpses, 10 recorded drops, 24 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/f51fcc7dea071d81fbeb.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ember Core</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1–3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-sword\" title=\"Titanium Sword - in 2 of 14 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9df6d6b127ab73a6a326.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Sword</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Crude: 1 of 2 · Excellent: 1 of 2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-kryss\" title=\"Titanium Kryss - in 2 of 14 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/59f833ee7c52ee8c1c91.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Kryss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 1 of 14 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4a127458a5f5f489058.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/14<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 1 of 14 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/14<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-dagger\" title=\"Titanium Dagger - in 1 of 14 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/76a2e17f4e9945d67b1f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Dagger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/14<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Crude: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"ember-core\" title=\"Ember Core - in 11 of 14 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 8 total, 8 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/f51fcc7