box\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/53bd7728255569d6ab4c.svg\" alt=\"Cinderling\"></div><h3>Cinderling</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>62</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 61)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Fire Elemental</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>burn · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>469</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>38.6</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3,100</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.2 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.95</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>22 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}